# Source and dev files Vercel doesn't need to serve. The built pages, js/,
# css/, fonts/, images/, models/ and api/ are what the live site uses.
# Each path starts with / so it only matches at the root: a bare "supabase/"
# also hid js/vendor/supabase/, and sign-up couldn't load.
/pages/
/scripts/
/supabase/
/tests/
/tools/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
# Internal notes (audit report, readme): not for the public site.
/*.md
